{"id":"39d7598f6fcde454","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-direct-limit-forcing.md","title":"ZFC Direct Limit Forcing","display":"df-zfc-direct-limit-forcing — ZFC Direct Limit Forcing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-direct-limit-forcing","aliases":["58-df-zfc-direct-limit-forcing"],"display":"df-zfc-direct-limit-forcing — ZFC Direct Limit Forcing","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-direct-limit-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-direct-limit-forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-direct-limit-forcing — ZFC Direct Limit Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta,\\mathbb P_\\delta,R_\\delta,\\mathbb P_\\bullet,R_\\bullet\\in V\">\\(\\delta,\\mathbb P_\\delta,R_\\delta,\\mathbb P_\\bullet,R_\\bullet\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrd}\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrd}\\)</span> (see dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirectLimitForcingStructure}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{DirectLimitForcingStructure}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirectLimitForcing}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{DirectLimitForcing}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (explicit predicate and compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}direct\\text{-}limit\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DirectLimitForcingStructure}_S(\\mathbb P_\\delta,R_\\delta,\\delta,\\mathbb P_\\bullet,R_\\bullet)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LimitOrd}(\\delta)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbb P_\\bullet,\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\},\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbb P_\\bullet))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(R_\\bullet,\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\},\\operatorname{ran}(R_\\bullet))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\}\\;\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P_\\bullet(\\alpha),R_\\bullet(\\alpha))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\delta\\;\\Bigl(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to\n\\mathbb P_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\mathbb P_\\bullet(\\beta)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land R_\\bullet(\\alpha)=R_\\bullet(\\beta)\\cap\\bigl(\\mathbb P_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\times\\mathbb P_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathbb P_\\delta=\\mathbb P_\\bullet(\\delta)=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\delta}\\mathbb P_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\land R_\\delta=R_\\bullet(\\delta)=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\delta}R_\\bullet(\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}direct\\text{-}limit\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DirectLimitForcingStructure}_S(\\mathbb P_\\delta,R_\\delta,\\delta,\\mathbb P_\\bullet,R_\\bullet)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LimitOrd}(\\delta)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbb P_\\bullet,\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\},\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbb P_\\bullet))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(R_\\bullet,\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\},\\operatorname{ran}(R_\\bullet))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\}\\;\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P_\\bullet(\\alpha),R_\\bullet(\\alpha))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\delta\\;\\Bigl(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to\n\\mathbb P_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\mathbb P_\\bullet(\\beta)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land R_\\bullet(\\alpha)=R_\\bullet(\\beta)\\cap\\bigl(\\mathbb P_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\times\\mathbb P_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathbb P_\\delta=\\mathbb P_\\bullet(\\delta)=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\delta}\\mathbb P_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\land R_\\delta=R_\\bullet(\\delta)=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\delta}R_\\bullet(\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}direct\\text{-}limit\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{DirectLimitForcing}_S(\\mathbb P_\\delta,\\mathbb P_\\bullet)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\delta,R_\\delta,R_\\bullet\\in V\\;\\mathrm{DirectLimitForcingStructure}_S(\\mathbb P_\\delta,R_\\delta,\\delta,\\mathbb P_\\bullet,R_\\bullet)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}direct\\text{-}limit\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{DirectLimitForcing}_S(\\mathbb P_\\delta,\\mathbb P_\\bullet)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\delta,R_\\delta,R_\\bullet\\in V\\;\\mathrm{DirectLimitForcingStructure}_S(\\mathbb P_\\delta,R_\\delta,\\delta,\\mathbb P_\\bullet,R_\\bullet)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The limit ordinal and every order relation are now bound arguments. The former formula used an undefined unary forcing predicate and free order symbols.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\delta,\\mathbb P_\\delta,R_\\delta,\\mathbb P_\\bullet,R_\\bullet\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LimitOrd}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirectLimitForcingStructure}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirectLimitForcing}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}direct\\text{-}limit\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DirectLimitForcingStructure}_S(\\mathbb P_\\delta,R_\\delta,\\delta,\\mathbb P_\\bullet,R_\\bullet)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{LimitOrd}(\\delta)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbb P_\\bullet,\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\},\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbb P_\\bullet))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(R_\\bullet,\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\},\\operatorname{ran}(R_\\bullet))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\}\\;\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P_\\bullet(\\alpha),R_\\bullet(\\alpha))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\delta\\;\\Bigl(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to\n\\mathbb P_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\mathbb P_\\bullet(\\beta)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land R_\\bullet(\\alpha)=R_\\bullet(\\beta)\\cap\\bigl(\\mathbb P_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\times\\mathbb P_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathbb P_\\delta=\\mathbb P_\\bullet(\\delta)=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\delta}\\mathbb P_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\\\\n&\\land R_\\delta=R_\\bullet(\\delta)=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\delta}R_\\bullet(\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}direct\\text{-}limit\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{DirectLimitForcing}_S(\\mathbb P_\\delta,\\mathbb P_\\bullet)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\delta,R_\\delta,R_\\bullet\\in V\\;\\mathrm{DirectLimitForcingStructure}_S(\\mathbb P_\\delta,R_\\delta,\\delta,\\mathbb P_\\bullet,R_\\bullet)","display":true}],"bytes":2295,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1855","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-direct-limit-forcing.md|58-df-zfc-direct-limit-forcing]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d3f859dbdd37f018","36d7463d215be751","81cabbac7fa4d75d"]}